sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as AI client
  participant M as ZyroPay MCP
  participant A as ZyroPay API
  participant U as You, in the app
  C->>M: POST /mcp with no token
  M-->>C: 401 and protected-resource metadata
  C->>M: OAuth 2.1 authorize with PKCE (S256), resource = /mcp
  M->>A: create a pending connection
  A-->>M: user code, for example ABCD-1234
  M-->>C: consent page shows the code
  U->>A: enter the code, review client name and redirect URI
  U->>A: approve, choosing wallets and networks
  Note over A: New agent: Always Ask, spending off, zero limits, no protocols
  M->>A: poll the connection
  A-->>M: approved, with userId and agentId
  M-->>C: authorization code, then tokens (15 min access, rotating refresh)
